# triangular_prism.obj
# A short equilateral-triangle prism (flat triangular "tile"), standing with
# its two triangular faces horizontal so a top-down camera sees a triangle
# silhouette — the same way the box gives a square silhouette and the
# cylinder gives a circle silhouette from directly above.
#
# Side length ~0.045m, height (extrusion) 0.04m, centered on its own origin
# in X/Y with the base at z=0 (matches how MuJoCo places box/cylinder geoms
# so all three objects sit flush on the table at the same local origin).

v 0.0 0.0259808 0.0
v -0.0225 -0.0129904 0.0
v 0.0225 -0.0129904 0.0
v 0.0 0.0259808 0.04
v -0.0225 -0.0129904 0.04
v 0.0225 -0.0129904 0.04

g triangular_prism
f 1 3 2
f 4 5 6
f 1 2 5
f 1 5 4
f 2 3 6
f 2 6 5
f 3 1 4
f 3 4 6
